Package: phenoscapR
Title: Read, Analyse, and Visualise Akoya Spatial Biology Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("phenoscapR contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "phenoscapr@example.com")
Description: Provides an S4 class ('AkoyaExperiment') and a pipe-friendly
    workflow for reading, processing, analysing, and visualising multiplexed
    spatial biology data produced by Akoya Biosciences platforms
    (PhenoCycler, CODEX, PhenoImager). Functions cover the full analysis
    pipeline from importing cell segmentation outputs through quality
    control, marker normalisation, cell phenotyping, spatial statistics
    (nearest neighbour distances, cell density, spatial interaction
    matrices), spatial clustering, and publication-ready visualisations.
